<dialog class="boarding" id="boardingDialog" aria-labelledby="boardingTitle" aria-describedby="boardingDescription" data-boarding-home="<%= is_home() ? 'true' : 'false' %>">
  <div class="boarding__scene">
    <img class="boarding__landscape" src="<%- url_for('/images/header-landscape.png') %>" alt="" loading="<%= is_home() ? 'eager' : 'lazy' %>" fetchpriority="<%= is_home() ? 'high' : 'low' %>" decoding="async" />
    <div class="boarding__veil" aria-hidden="true"></div>
    <div class="boarding__grain" aria-hidden="true"></div>
    <div class="boarding__leaves" aria-hidden="true"><i></i><i></i><i></i><i></i><i></i></div>
    <header class="boarding__header">
      <span class="boarding__brand"><img src="<%- url_for('/images/ghibli-houseboat-logo.svg') %>" alt="" width="44" height="44" /><span>吉卜力画舫<small>GHIBLI HOUSEBOAT</small></span></span>
      <button class="boarding__skip" type="button" data-boarding-close>跳过，直接进入 <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></button>
    </header>
    <div class="boarding__content">
      <div class="boarding__poem">
        <p class="boarding__eyebrow"><span aria-hidden="true"></span> 一张开往慢生活的船票</p>
        <h2 id="boardingTitle">风起了，<br />我们出发吧<span>。</span></h2>
        <p id="boardingDescription">把匆忙留在岸边。<br />带上好奇心，去日常里寻找一点奇迹。</p>
        <span class="boarding__japanese" lang="ja">風の向くまま、心のまま。</span>
      </div>
      <section class="boarding__ticket" aria-label="吉卜力画舫登船券">
        <div class="boarding__ticket-main">
          <div class="boarding__ticket-top"><span>湖畔 · 登船券</span><small>ONE WAY TO EVERYDAY</small></div>
          <div class="boarding__route"><span><small>从这里</small><strong>此刻</strong></span><svg viewBox="0 0 90 24" fill="none" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M1 12h84m-9-8 9 8-9 8" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.2"/><circle cx="20" cy="12" r="3" fill="currentColor"/></svg><span><small>去往</small><strong>心之所向</strong></span></div>
          <div class="boarding__ticket-bottom"><span>旅人 <b>每一个偶然到来的你</b></span><span class="boarding__stamp" aria-hidden="true">慢 慢<br />航 行</span></div>
        </div>
        <div class="boarding__ticket-stub">
          <button class="boarding__enter" type="button" data-boarding-close autofocus><span>登上画舫</span><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M4 12h15m-6-6 6 6-6 6" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"/></svg></button>
          <p>不必赶路，沿途都是风景。</p>
        </div>
      </section>
    </div>
    <footer class="boarding__footer"><span>日常 / 阅读 / 远方</span><span>一叶画舫，收藏人间的温柔。</span><span>EST. 2025 <i aria-hidden="true">✦</i></span></footer>
  </div>
</dialog>
